        "message": "=*Brief for approval*\n*Team:* {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.team }}\n*Urgency:* {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.urgency }}\n*Routing reason:* {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.routing_reason }}\n\n*Draft brief:*\n{{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.brief_text }}\n\n*Source:* {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.url }}",
